<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results from the</p>
<p>Czech Open women's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Brenda Schult-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Radka Zrubakova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>2-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Magdalena Grzybowska</p>
<p>(Poland) 6-3 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>3-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Gala Leon-Garica (Spain)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Wiltrud Probst (Germany) beat 4-Patty Schnyder (Switzerland)</p>
<p>3-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>5-Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) beat Milena Nekvapilova</p>
<p>(Czech Republic) 6-7 (10-12) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Marion Maruska (Austria) beat 7-Katarina Studenikova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>Nina Louarsabishvili (Belarus) beat 8-Sandra Kleinova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 3-6 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Alex Dechaume-Balleret (France) beat Eva Martincova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Radka Bobkova (Czech Republic) beat Eva Melicharova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Ludmila Richterova (Czech Republic) beat Radka Pelikanova</p>
<p>(Czech Republic) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Joanette Kruger (South Africa) beat Olga Barabanshchikova</p>
<p>(Belarus) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Veronika Martinek (Germany) beat Petra Langrova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Mariana Diaz-Oliva (Agrentina) beat Paola Suarez (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Rene Simpson (Canada) beat Kristie Boogert (Netherlands) 7-5</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Catalina Cristea (Romania) beat Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-2 0-1 (Gersi retired injured)</p>
<p>Laurence Courtois (Belgium) beat Jana Kandarrova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-2 7-6 (9-7)</p>
</text>
